          "abstract": "<jats:title>Summary</jats:title>\n               <jats:p>Residuals are usually defined in connection with linear models. Here a more general definition is given and some asymptotic properties found. Some illustrative examples are discussed, including a regression problem involving exponentially distributed errors and some problems concerning Poisson and binomially distributed observations.</jats:p>",
